        "title": "Divisibility and Primes",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The structure: divisibility defines a **partial order** on N.\nPrimes are the atoms — the irreducible elements of this order.\nUFT says the partial order has a unique decomposition in terms of atoms."
    },
