        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "For any integers a, b with b > 0:\n```\n∃! q, r ∈ Z:  a = qb + r,  0 ≤ r < |b|"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-DIVISIBILITY-PRIMES.md#007",
