        "title": "Divisibility and Primes",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "This is not just a computational tool — it is the axiom that makes Z a\nEuclidean domain, which guarantees gcd exists and Bezout holds."
    },
    {
      "id": "01-DIVISIBILITY-PRIMES.md#009",
      "path": [
        "01-DIVISIBILITY-PRIMES.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:number-theory:01-divisibility-primes, git-history:number-theory:01-divisibility-primes]",
        "canonical_path": "number-theory/01-DIVISIBILITY-PRIMES.md",
