        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Divisibility and Primes",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Euclid's Algorithm:**\n```\ngcd(a, b):\n  while b ≠ 0:\n    a, b = b, a mod b\n  return a"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-DIVISIBILITY-PRIMES.md#010",
      "path": [
        "01-DIVISIBILITY-PRIMES.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
