        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Divisibility and Primes",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Example: gcd(1071, 462)\n  1071 = 2·462 + 147   → gcd(462, 147)\n   462 = 3·147 + 21    → gcd(147, 21)\n   147 = 7·21 + 0      → return 21"
    },
