      },
      "text": "**Extended Euclidean** — tracks Bezout coefficients:\n```\ngcd(a,b) = sa + tb  for some s,t ∈ Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-DIVISIBILITY-PRIMES.md#014",
      "path": [
        "01-DIVISIBILITY-PRIMES.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
