        "section": "number-theory",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Divisibility and Primes",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Algorithm maintains two rows (s₀,t₀,r₀) and (s₁,t₁,r₁):\n  Start: (1,0,a) and (0,1,b)\n  Step: q = r₀ div r₁; new row = old_row₀ - q·old_row₁"
    },
