      },
      "text": "Proof: If p ∤ a, then gcd(p,a) = 1 (p has no divisors between 1 and p).\n       Bezout: sp + ta = 1\n       Multiply by b: spb + tab = b\n       p | spb and p | pab, so p | b.  □"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-DIVISIBILITY-PRIMES.md#028",
      "path": [
        "01-DIVISIBILITY-PRIMES.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
