        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Divisibility and Primes",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Theorem (Fundamental Theorem of Arithmetic):**\nEvery integer n > 1 has a unique representation:\n```\nn = p₁^{a₁} · p₂^{a₂} · ... · pₖ^{aₖ}"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-DIVISIBILITY-PRIMES.md#032",
